{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19236","headline":"和仆射牛相公寓言二首 一 · 刘禹锡","name":"和仆射牛相公寓言二首 一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"两度竿头立定夸，回眸举袖拂青霞。\n尽抛今日贵人样，复振前朝名相家。\n御史定来休直宿，尚书依旧趂参衙。\n具瞻尊重诚无敌，犹忆洛阳千树花。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘禹锡","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_19236.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19236","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}